:: Fishing Coast Path Catch
<<if Weather.dayState is "day" and $rng gte 90 and $daily.fishing.seagullSteal is undefined>>
	<<fishingSeagullCatch $fishingHookedFish $bus>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingCoastPathCatch>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Coast Path Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingCoastPathCatch">>
	<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		아주 작은 물고기라, 한입에 다 넣을 수도 있을 것 같다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name + " 보관하기"|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>>
		<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
		<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<endevent>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
	<<if _canEatFish>>
		<br>
		<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Coast Path Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Cut
<<effects>>
당신은 낚싯줄을 <span class="purple">끊어버렸고</span>, <<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【은는】 깊은 물 속으로 헤엄쳐 도망간다.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "cut">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Fishing Coast Path Approach]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Snapped
낚싯줄이 팽팽해지더니, 이내 <span class="red">끊어진다.</span> <<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【은는】 사라졌다.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "lineSnapped">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[다시 미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Fishing Coast Path Approach]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Fish Too Far
<<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【이가】 낚싯줄 끝까지 도달해 바늘을 풀고 <span class="red">도망쳤다</span>.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "fishOffHook">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[미끼를 꿰어 낚싯줄을 던진다 (0:03)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Fishing Coast Path Approach]]>><</link>>
